        "ContentType": "ECyCommunicationContentType::Text",
        "TextContent": {
          "Namespace": "Lawine_128_Lv_7",
          "Key": "Row10_TextContent_FromRoleId128",
          "SourceString": "她会在香包里塞上薰草、艾叶、秋兰等许多香料，放在衣服里能够起到熏香的效果。",
          "LocalizedString": "She would fill sachets with lavender, mugwort, and autumn orchids, then wear them on her clothes like incense."
